Algorithm to Create a Gmail Account 
Step 1: Start. 
Step 2: Open a browser or the Gmail app. 
Step 3: Click on "Create an account" and select the account purpose. 
Step 4: Enter your name, and if you want you can add your last name and click on next. 
Step 5: Enter your date of birth, and if you want choose your gender and click on next. 
Step 6: Enter an unique username for your account, click next. 
Step 7: Create a strong password with mix of letters, numbers, and symbols and confirm your password. 
Step 8: Click on next. 
Step 9: To prevent abuse, verify your information and if correct then click on continue. 
Step 10: Add recovery email for Google to contact you if an unusual activity occurs or if you get locked. 
Step 11: Skip if don't want to enter the recovery email. 
Step 12: Read and agree to the privacy and terms. 
Step 13: Your new account info will be seen. 
Step 14: Stop.

Algorithm to Log in to Gmail Account 
Step 1: Start. 
Step 2: Open a browser or an app. 
Step 3: Open Gmail. 
Step 4: Click on "Add another account". 
Step 5: Enter a valid email address. 
Step 6: If your email id is correct enter your password or try another way. 
Step 7: Else display "Enter valid email id" and go to Step 5. 
Step 8: If your password is correct you will be redirected to the home of your Gmail account. 
Step 9: Else display "Enter correct password" and go to Step 6, ie re-enter your password. 
Step 10: Stop.
